      "en": "Each Dockerfile line is a layer, and **layer caching** reuses layers whose inputs did not change. So: copy the dependency files (pyproject and uv.lock) and install first, then copy the code. Editing one line of code does not reinstall the libraries. **uv in docker** with a cache mount makes builds take seconds."
